        "Standard Selection Questionnaire (SQ)"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In: Procure > Contract award and implementation",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [
        "Standard Selection Questionnaire (SQ)"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "Standard Selection Questionnaire (SQ)",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This PPN provides updates to the Standard Selection Questionnaire (SQ) and accompanying statutory guidance.",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Standard Selection Questionnaire (SQ)",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This PPN applies to all contracting authorities in England, and contract authorities in Wales and Northern Ireland that exercise wholly or mainly reserved functions, in each case when undertaking above threshold procurements within Part 2 of the Public Contracts Regulations 2015 (PCR 2015).",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Standard Selection Questionnaire (SQ)",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Objective at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Standard Selection Questionnaire (SQ)",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Whilst a bidder is not required to produce supporting documentary evidence or certificates until specifically requested, the contracting authority must request this evidence from the successful supplier before awarding the contract.",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Standard Selection Questionnaire (SQ)",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Key considerations at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Standard Selection Questionnaire (SQ)",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contracting authorities should:",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Standard Selection Questionnaire (SQ)",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "require a successful supplier to produce supporting documentary evidence or certificates before awarding the contract, in order to demonstrate that the successful supplier continues to meet the relevant selection requirements",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Standard Selection Questionnaire (SQ)",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "not award the contract to the successful supplier where it is unable to provide reasonable evidence to demonstrate that it satisfies the relevant selection requirements.",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Standard Selection Questionnaire (SQ)",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Legal framework",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Standard Selection Questionnaire (SQ)",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The PPN should be read alongside the relevant parts of the legal framework, including but not limited to, the following provisions of the Public Contracts Regulations 2015 (which may be particularly relevant to the consideration of this PPN):",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Standard Selection Questionnaire (SQ)",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "Regulation 19: Economic operators",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Standard Selection Questionnaire (SQ)",
